nd_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.024710070905047635,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":38.6,"_gate_share_shrink":null,"_gp_share_shrink":null,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":null,"_gp_sbc_dilution":null,"_score_sbc_dilution":0.0,"_gate_insider_own":0.60487,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":100.0,"_gate_insider_buying":0.923,"_gp_insider_buying":true,"_score_insider_buying":92.3,"pf":[],"description_full":"OppFi Inc., a tech-enabled digital finance platform, provides financial products and services for banks in the United States. The company offers installment loans through OppLoans platform. It serves consumers who are turned away by mainstream options. OppFi Inc. was founded in 2012 and is based in Chicago, Illinois.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Todd G. Schwartz | Founder, Executive Chairman & CEO | Age 42 | Compensation: $462,522 (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 410 people. Each employee generates $932K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $24K per employee reflects an ownership culture. Governance score flags elevated compensation governance risk (10/10).","financial_summary":["OppFi Inc. is a small-cap financial services business with a $888M market cap.","Returns on capital run at 1122% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 1112-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $382M in free cash flow, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 15.24\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","Accruals are elevated at -49.7% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and interest coverage runs at 4.6\u00d7.","Shareholder yield of 2.5% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insiders hold 60% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Above-average short interest at 5.0% of float","sev":"amber","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Above-average market volatility (VIX 26)","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Late-cycle dynamics increase the probability of a slowdown","sev":"amber","cat":"macro"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Reinvestment rate supports 30% organic growth capacity \u2014 capital is compounding inside the business","Trading at a 79% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","Insiders are net buyers (92% buy ratio) \u2014 insiders sell for many reasons but buy for only one","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Technical Reactions to OPFI Trends in Macro Strategies","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/89/Technical_Reactions_to_OPFI_Trends_in_Macro_Strategies_110626032201_1793996521.html","date":"2026-11-06","timestamp":1793996521.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Analyzing OppFi (NYSE:OPFI) and World Acceptance (NASDAQ:WRLD)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/04/analyzing-oppfi-nyseopfi-and-world-acceptance-nasdaqwrld.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793809736.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.946,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Head to Head Comparison: OppFi (NYSE:OPFI) & Consumer Portfolio Services (NASDAQ:CPSS)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/02/head-to-head-comparison-oppfi-nyseopfi-consumer-portfolio-services-nasdaqcpss.html","date":"2026-11-03","timestamp":1793668497.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.924,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Northland Securities Has Negative View of OppFi Q3 Earnings","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/05/northland-securities-has-negative-view-of-oppfi-q3-earnings.html","date":"2026-11-05","timestamp":1793879352.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.869,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"OppFi to Participate in November 2026 Conferences","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/small-business/articles/oppfi-participate-november-2026-conferences-211500268.html","date":"2026-11-04","timestamp":1793826900.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.0,"tier":1,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"OppFi Withdraws Regulatory Appli